{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 12, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "Now, fair traveller, lend thine ear to my tale,\nA journey through the land of rising sun, a quest to fulfill.\nFrom thy port of call, to Tokyo's heart, by train or plane, thou shalt arrive,\nUnder the neon lights, thy first night will be, in the city's embrace, thy soul shall thrive.\n\nNext morn, to Senso-ji Temple, to pray and to explore,\nIn Asakusa, the ancient ways, thy spirit shall be restored.\nThen to the Meiji Shrine, in the heart of Shibuya,\nWhere modern and old, in harmony, shall together play.\n\nTo Kyoto, thou must then, by bullet train, proceed,\nThe city of a thousand temples, where culture, history, and beauty bleed.\nIn Gion, the geisha's dance, and the Kiyomizu-dera's grace,\nShall steal thy heart, and leave thee, in a trance.\n\nThe Philosopher's Path, to stroll, where cherry blossoms bloom,\nIn spring, a sight to behold, a dream come true.\nTo Nara, then, to see, the ancient deer,\nIn sacred park, thy presence, they will greet with a cheer.\n\nOsaka, the city of rice, and the laughter never cease,\nThe Dōtonbori lights, shall dance, and thy spirit, they'll appease.\n\nLast, to Hiroshima, a city, of peace and of light,\nThe museum's tale, of sorrow and might,\nShall teach thee, the cost of war, and the hope for the night.\n\nThus, thy journey, through Japan, shall be, a tale to recite,\nOf beauty, and culture, and history, a sight to delight.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Now", "logprob": -3.905292510986328}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.0829936265945435}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.7693252563476562}, {"token": " trav", "logprob": -0.8243418335914612}, {"token": "eller", "logprob": -0.0008592489175498486}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.005784201435744762}, {"token": " lend", "logprob": -0.9336940050125122}, {"token": " th", "logprob": -0.12008699774742126}, {"token": "ine", "logprob": -5.304672595229931e-05}, {"token": "